Version 0.14 2017-04-25
Added @admin_required on more functions.

Version 0.13 2017-04-25
    Added password to register user.
    Added log in to register post and register many posts.
    Must be an admin to see the Reports, auction and fleamarket pages.
    Changed Register many posts so the user can select which type of post should be default for all the posts, can be changed individually.
    Added create timestamp to seller and posts datatable, and sold timestamp on posts datatable in the database.
    List of posts shows total number of posts and how many are registered in auction and fleamarket.
    Fixed bug in economic rapport, if a seller hadn't sold anything the pdf generation faild.
    Fixed bug in link to individual labels and receipt.
    Post id input has autofocus in auction page.

Version 0.12 2017-03-21
    Finished the economic report.
    Added receipt for seller to sign, that they got their money.

Version 0.11 2017-03-21
    Updated README.md with better description on how to get the system working on the server.

Version 0.10 2017-03-03
    Added pdfs for economic report, receipt.
    Updated make_database, with more datafields.

Version 0.9 2017-02-27
    Changed name of user.py to user_model.py because there was a conflict with some other python package on the server.
    Added a rudimentary  notification about the current logged in person.
    Also I forgot to write in the last commit about the new register many posts view.

Version 0.8 2017-02-27
    Added support for login and registration of passwords that are encrypted with bcrypt in the database.
    Support for regular users and admin users.

Version 0.7 2017-02-20
    Added a page for adding multiple posts.

Version 0.6 2017-02-11
    Added text in README.md.
    Fixed a small bug in the auction page, the number and price were not nulled when commiting an auction sell.

Version 0.5 Initial commit to gitlab
    This is a python program built with Flask for use during auctions and fleamarkets by an aquarium club.

